  ProjectName: Machine Showcase
  ClientName: Empigest
  Tags: 2
  Texts:
  - category: 0
    info: Lead Developer.
  - category: 1
    info: EMPIGEST has serviced forklifts and industrial machines since 2007, regardless
      of brand or customer size.
  - category: 2
    info: A mobile VR experience (Google VR SDK) that shows EMPIGEST's autonomous
      machines working on their own, with no direct human control.
  - category: 3
    info: Several autonomous machines had to operate in the same scene at once without
      interfering with each other.
  - category: 9
    info: '- Wrote each machine''s behaviour as a self-contained component with minimal
      dependencies on the others.

      - This kept the simulation predictable
      and easy to extend with new machines.'
